static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271960/extras/82d23d0fc7de529ec17fce434afaf3c1.poster.avif?t=1741369773\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271960/extras/82d23d0fc7de529ec17fce434afaf3c1.webm?t=1741369773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271960/extras/82d23d0fc7de529ec17fce434afaf3c1.mp4?t=1741369773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can <strong>you</strong> figure out a way to build an efficient factory with the limited space you have?</p>",
